+  the document compaction, the suggestion-outcome sweep, the delivery resume, the reference-excerpt reconciliation, the block-index reconciliation, the webhook redelivery sweep, the architecture import, the delivery reconcile and the delivery intakes' consumer reconciliation, which takes one lease per durable, so ten callers hold a lease at once at most (`store.leasePoolSize`).
